      "writtenOn": "2025-03-20T08:34:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a small constant. I don\u0027t think it\u0027s worth to include it in the uniform buffer. It would help reduce the uniform buffer\u0027s size and the compiler would boost the calculation perf a little bit since this is usually power of 2.\n\nBtw, I have changed this to generating the constant value directly in the shader text, based on the input format. So no need for override anymore.",
